  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7dff035f-ffcc-4c6c-b33b-9dbeaa87f66b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"826\" height=\"579\"></p><p>《逝者野獸》為遊戲添加了多種具有特殊能力的殭屍化野獸。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/479710/description_10b5a2af-fa39-4596-9ac1-032cfeab218a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"788\" height=\"41\"></p><p>本模組專為與尚未發布的《逝者工藝》整合包相容而設計，但您目前亦可將其作為獨立模組遊玩。目前僅有四種野獸，除非透過其他模組指定或修改，否則牠們皆無自然生成或掉落物。<br>逝者工藝：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/deceasedcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/deceasedcraft</a></p><p><strong>本模組不會移植至其他新舊版本的Minecraft，且必須安裝Gecko Lib才能遊玩。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/479710/description_be49ce30-69a4-48c0-b154-81e05e915874.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"788\" height=\"41\"><br></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>面孔：朝你投擲生物與岩石。</strong><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fmbVRQOQfsKs%253fsi%253dxeC5e71-sGLa1WLa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/mbVRQOQfsKs?si=xeC5e71-sGLa1WLa</a><br><strong>挖掘者：傳送並對你釋放震波<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fKMsX6YX0G-s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/KMsX6YX0G-s</a><br>剝皮人：撕咬並朝你嘔吐，其軀幹節段越多則越強。<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252f8QeaI5vBfOo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/8QeaI5vBfOo</a><br>守護者：黏附於天花板以觸手攻擊！優先攻擊其觸手！否則你將後悔莫及。<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252faNincNBprY8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/aNincNBprY8</a></strong></p>\n</div>",
